# Do the written summaries say what the data says? A check of the top five summaries of the five sample ToRs, and the live check after the fix.
# Date: 2026-11-22. Context: P1 ran the deployed engine of pull request 79 (summary-v2). P2 and P3 ran the code of pull request 82 on 20 real candidates per run with Nova Lite. Checked: the numbers, the band, claims that every priority was met against the stored priority rows, and Fit sentences that name an excluded attribute.

### P1 The five sample ToRs through the deployed engine, 25 top five summaries checked against the stored data
