ISSUES:
 - tor-01 #3 Yonas Alemu: says all priorities met, data has 2 not fully met (Statistical Analysis:partial, Senior:partial)
      "The candidate ranks as a strong match with a total score of 90. Their Fit score of 90 comes from proven experience in nutrition evaluation, survey design, and statistical analysis. They met all must-haves and priority rows, including strong expertise in nutrition and impact evaluation, and slight expertise in health systems and survey design."
 - tor-02 #1 Lucía Barrios Cifuentes: says all priorities met, data has 1 not fully met (Data Science:not_met)
      "The candidate ranks as a strong match with a total score of 94. Their fit score of 95 shows extensive relevant experience and expertise. They met all must-haves and priority rows, including anti-corruption and public procurement as core expertise. They also met the slight priority of being based in Guatemala."
 - tor-02 #2 Andrés Castillo Zelaya: says all priorities met, data has 2 not fully met (Citizen Engagement:partial, Policy Analysis:partial)
      "The candidate ranks as a strong match with a total score of 88. Their fit score of 90 shows proven experience in procurement data analysis and open contracting. They met all must-haves and priority rows, including strong anti-corruption and public procurement expertise, and core data science skills. They also met the slight priority of being based in Tegucigalpa, Honduras."
 - tor-03 #2 Omar Khalil Mansour: says all priorities met, data has 1 not fully met (Qualitative Research:partial)
      "The candidate ranks as a strong match with a total score of 93. Their fit score of 95 shows proven experience in market assessments, SME support, and social cohesion. They met all priority rows, including strong expertise in refugees and forced displacement, and slight expertise in SME development and market research. They also met the must-have of speaking Arabic fluently."
 - tor-05 #3 Aminata Koné-Traoré: says all priorities met, data has 2 not fully met (Software Development:partial, Information Systems:partial)
      "The candidate ranks in the Strong match band with a total score of 89. Their Fit score is 90, driven by proven experience in e-procurement, change management, and interoperability. They met all must-haves and priority rows, including strong expertise in Digital Governance, Public Procurement, and Change Management. They are based in Abidjan, Côte d'Ivoire."
RESULT: 23 real summaries and 2 template fallbacks. Numbers right in 23 of 23, no Fit sentence naming an excluded attribute, and 5 of 23 summaries said every priority was met while a row was partly met or not met. 23 of 23 start with The candidate ranks and 18 of 23 use the word proven.

